		{
			"id":"c_hub",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"⚡ Semantic Caching\nLayer",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1270,
			"y":0,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#00cec9"
		},
		{
			"id":"c_concept",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Cache Concept\n— Embed incoming query\n— Compare vs cache index\n— Similarity > 0.95: serve cache\n— 70% LLM cost reduction",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1270,
			"y":120,
			"width":260,
			"height":110,
			"color":"#00cec9"
		},
		{
			"id":"d_hub",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"💾 State Persistence\n& Checkpointing",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":0,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#e17055"
		},
		{
			"id":"c_redisvl",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 RedisVL SemanticCache\n— SemanticCache class\n— store(key, response)\n— check(query) → hit/miss\n— In-memory sub-ms lookup",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1270,
			"y":260,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#00cec9"
		},
		{
			"id":"c_pgvector",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ pgvector 0.8.0 Cache\n— VECTOR column in Postgres\n— HNSW cache index\n— 5.7x query perf in v0.8.0\n— Co-located app DB option",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1270,
			"y":520,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#00cec9"
		},
		{
			"id":"c_invalidation",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Cache Invalidation\n— TTL-based expiry (EXPIRE)\n— Source doc update trigger\n— Threshold tuning: precision vs hit-rate\n— Versioned cache namespaces",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1270,
			"y":650,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#00cec9"
		},
		{
			"id":"c_math",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Cache Hit Math\n— Similarity threshold θ\n— Hit rate = P(sim > θ)\n— Expected cost = (1-HR)×C_llm\n— Latency: P50 cache < 5ms",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1270,
			"y":780,
			"width":260,
			"height":110,
			"color":"#6c3483"
		},
		{
			"id":"c_gptcache",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ GPTCache / LLMCache\n— Exact + semantic match\n— Multi-tier cache layers\n— Async pre-warming\n— A/B threshold testing",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1270,
			"y":920,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#00cec9"
		},
		{
			"id":"d_redis_cp",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Redis Checkpointer\n— LangGraph RedisSaver\n— Serialize state on each node\n— thread_id scoped isolation\n— TTL for conversation expiry",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":120,
			"width":260,
			"height":110,
			"color":"#e17055"
		},
		{
			"id":"c_langcache",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Redis LangCache\n— set_llm_cache(RedisSemanticCache)\n— Transparent across LLM calls\n— No code changes needed\n— Drop-in LangChain layer",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1270,
			"y":390,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#00cec9"
		},
		{
			"id":"d_pg_cp",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 PostgreSQL Checkpointer\n— AsyncPostgresSaver\n— ACID state storage\n— Full audit trail of transitions\n— Crash-recoverable execution",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":260,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#e17055"
		},
		{
			"id":"d_eventsource",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Event Sourcing\n— Append-only event log\n— State = replay(events)\n— Time-travel debugging\n— Kafka / Redis Streams",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":390,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#e17055"
		},
		{
			"id":"d_pubsub",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Pub/Sub Pipelines\n— Redis Pub/Sub channels\n— Inter-agent notifications\n— State change broadcasts\n— Fan-out coordination",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":520,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#e17055"
		},
		{
			"id":"d_crossregion",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Cross-Region State Sharing\n— Redis Cluster geo-replication\n— Active-active vs active-passive\n— Agent handoff across DCs\n— Sub-second state sync",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":640,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#e17055"
		},
		{
			"id":"d_atomic",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Atomic State Operations\n— Lua scripting in Redis\n— Read-modify-write atomicity\n— RESP3 reduced round-trips\n— Pipeline batching patterns",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":770,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#e17055"
		},
		{
			"id":"d_schema",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ State Schema Design\n— TypedDict state definitions\n— Annotated reducers (append vs replace)\n— Versioned state migrations\n— Backward-compat patterns",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":890,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#e17055"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_hub",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🤖 Memory Automation\n& Advanced Patterns",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":0,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#55efc4"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_multiagent",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Multi-Agent Memory\n— Shared memory pool\n— Agents read/write common store\n— Implicit coordination\n— Namespace isolation per role",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":120,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#55efc4"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_multimodal",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Multimodal Memory\n— Image embed storage\n— Audio transcript indexing\n— Video frame summaries\n— Unified retrieval interface",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":250,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#55efc4"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_rl",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ RL Memory Integration\n— Experience replay buffers\n— Episodic memory for RL agents\n— Reward-signal memory adapt\n— Policy gradient + memory",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":380,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#55efc4"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_forget",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Forgetting Mechanisms\n— Importance-weighted decay\n— Access frequency scoring\n— Retrieval score threshold\n— Schedule-based pruning",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":510,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#55efc4"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_reflect",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Memory Reflection\n— Agent reflects on memories\n— Synthesizes higher-order facts\n— Generalize across episodes\n— Generative Agents paper",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":630,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#55efc4"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_proactive",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Proactive Memory\n— Pre-fetch relevant history\n— Anticipate topic from context\n— Background pre-embedding\n— Warm cache on session start",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":760,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#55efc4"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_math",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Memory Math\n— Ebbinghaus forgetting curve\n— Retention: R = e^(-t/S)\n— Spaced repetition scheduling\n— Importance score = f(freq, recency, relevance)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":880,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#6c3483"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_hub",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🧩 Long-Term Semantic\n& Entity Memory",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":930,
			"y":-340,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#6c5ce7"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_dynsum",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Dynamic Summarization\n— Progressive diff-summarize\n— Update summary per new turn\n— Avoids full re-summary cost\n— Compression: O(log n) calls",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":930,
			"y":-220,
			"width":260,
			"height":110,
			"color":"#6c5ce7"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_vecstore",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Writing to Vector Layer\n— Embed compressed summary\n— Upsert to per-user namespace\n— summary_id + timestamp meta\n— Queryable across sessions",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":930,
			"y":-80,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#6c5ce7"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_mem0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Mem0 Architecture\n— Hierarchical memory manager\n— OS-inspired virtual memory\n— Auto: keep in-ctx vs offload\n— Importance-scored retention",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":930,
			"y":310,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#6c5ce7"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_memgpt",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ MemGPT / LangMem\n— Paging: active vs archival\n— Self-directed memory edits\n— Retrieve from archival on need\n— Autonomous memory agent",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":930,
			"y":440,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#6c5ce7"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_zep",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Zep Memory Store\n— Auto fact extraction\n— Graph-based entity relations\n— Temporal context queries\n— Production-ready service",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":930,
			"y":560,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#6c5ce7"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_crosssess",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Cross-Session Retrieval\n— Semantic search over summaries\n— 'What did we discuss about X?'\n— Relevance-weighted recall\n— Context-aware memory load",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":930,
			"y":50,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#6c5ce7"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_entity",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Entity Memory\n— Named entity extraction (NER)\n— Key-value store: entity→facts\n— Redis Hash per user/entity\n— Auto-update on new mentions",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":930,
			"y":180,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#fd79a8"
		},
		{
			"id":"a_hub",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"💬 Session &\nBuffer Memory",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":-460,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#0984e3"
		},
		{
			"id":"a_rolling",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Windowed Rolling Buffer\n— Fixed-size deque of N msgs\n— FIFO eviction on overflow\n— ConversationBufferWindowMemory\n— Memory: O(N×avg_tokens)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":-340,
			"width":260,
			"height":110,
			"color":"#0984e3"
		},
		{
			"id":"a_token",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Token-Aware Truncation\n— Count tokens not messages\n— tiktoken per-model counting\n— Ensure ctx window budget\n— Verbosity-agnostic trimming",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":-200,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#0984e3"
		},
		{
			"id":"a_multisess",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Multi-Session Continuity\n— Persist state: Redis/Postgres\n— thread_id scoped isolation\n— Reload history on resume\n— Session expiry via TTL",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":-70,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#0984e3"
		},
		{
			"id":"a_types",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 LangChain Memory Types\n— ConversationBufferMemory\n— ConversationSummaryMemory\n— SummaryBufferMemory\n— ConversationKGMemory",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":60,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#0984e3"
		},
		{
			"id":"a_compression",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Token Compression\n— Selective message pruning\n— High-salience turn keeping\n— TF-IDF salience scoring\n— LLMLingua context compress",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":190,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#0984e3"
		},
		{
			"id":"a_stateless",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Stateless vs Stateful\n— Stateless: no memory, cheap\n— Stateful: persistent context\n— Hybrid: cache recent, archive old\n— Design pattern selection guide",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":320,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#0984e3"
		},
		{
			"id":"a_redis_sess",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Redis Session Backend\n— Hash: session_id → messages\n— EXPIRE for auto-cleanup\n— Pub/Sub for real-time sync\n— Pipeline batching reads",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":440,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#0984e3"
